<title>SINGAPORE: Cerebos 1996 net profit up 11 pct.</title>
<headline>Cerebos 1996 net profit up 11 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months ended September 30 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		 102.15  vs    91.96</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)    32.70  vs    29.60</p>
<p>    Final Dividend (cents)  13.00  vs    11.80</p>
<p>    Bonus Dividend (cents)   3.30  vs     2.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		   686.02  vs   654.67</p>
<p>    Interest income	    5.93  vs     4.88</p>
<p>    Associates		   1.06  vs     1.96</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    151.39  vs   142.15</p>
<p>    Tax			   40.66  vs    41.40</p>
<p>    Minority		    (8.58) vs    (8.79)</p>
<p>    Extraordinary	     64.96  vs     5.36</p>
<p>Div pay  - March 27 1997</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Cerebos Pacific Ltd</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
